ica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">哈佛与MIT联合推出MatrAIx系统，开源83亿AI智能体模拟全球人类行为</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Vercel开源实验性编程语言Zero，专为AI Agent设计并以图为源码</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic披露未发布模型Model 2，性能表现略超Claude Mythos 5</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度发布2026年二季度财报：营收313亿元，AI业务占比连续两季过半</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e1b3478cf049b0925d3c416bac15f365.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度发布2026年第二季度财报，季度总营收达313亿元，其中AI业务收入占比达50%，连续两个季度超过总营收的一半。核心业务方面，AI云基础设施收入为73亿元，同比增长50%，其中GPU云业务同比增长283%，连续四个季度保持三位数增长。在AI应用领域，百度完成办公产品线整合，形成以百度搭子、库库AI、秒哒为核心的产品矩阵。其中，库库AI办公MAU超2500万，位居赛道第一；百度秒哒3.5版本以33.4%的市场份额领跑AI原生无代码应用生成平台。此外，百度AI原生营销服务收入达26亿元，智能体百度伐谋已有3000家企业申请试用。李彦宏表示，百度正加速向AI优先型企业转型，AI已成为公司营收与长期增长的核心驱动力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微信灰度测试AI助手小微新功能，AI入口增至16个并优化转账撤回</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/a3af946b69ccbd7e7cec7111696bf234.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微信近期在原生AI助手“小微”的灰度测试中新增3个高频场景入口，使微信内AI入口总数达到16个。新增功能包括：公众号消息页“AI总结”可整理常看内容；文章详情页支持一键总结；长按朋友圈文字可唤起“AI点评”；图片查看底部新增“AI处理”支持美化与信息提取；朋友圈发布页提供“AI帮写”；“扫一扫”新增“拍照给AI”功能；聊天输入框支持语境指令生成。转账功能新增“向银行卡或手机号转账”，撤回提示支持从个人页面删除。针对用户关注的“朋友圈二次编辑”，微信官方明确表示该功能永不推出，但提供“重新编辑”按钮以支持快速修正错字错图。目前上述AI功能均处于灰度测试阶段，仅随机部分用户可见，撤回提示优化正逐步覆盖iOS与安卓平台。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">哈佛与MIT联合推出MatrAIx系统，开源83亿AI智能体模拟全球人类行为</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b3539be74eca7f9adcc48fb6b570bbed.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">哈佛大学与麻省理工学院联合OpenAI及谷歌DeepMind团队，于2026年8月发布MatrAIx系统，成功生成83亿个AI智能体以模拟全球人类行为。该系统通过1290个维度对不同背景人群建模，使智能体具备填问卷、聊客服、刷网页及操作App等能力。在400次对照测试中，智能体行为一致性达91.5%，其中问卷与聊天场景表现优异，准确率最高达96%，App操控场景则为83%。目前，经质量过滤的百万“人格核心集”已上架Hugging Face，相关8B人格模型代码已在GitHub开源。该系统旨在为社科与产品研究提供大规模仿真试验场，但其替代真实人类样本的有效性仍需进一步交叉验证。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Vercel开源实验性编程语言Zero，专为AI Agent设计并以图为源码</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/196093afa56cea039a89f2f6c8e6213e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Vercel Labs近日在GitHub开源了实验性编程语言Zero，该语言定位为专供AI Agent使用的编程语言，而非传统的人类开发语言。Zero的核心机制是将程序视为语义图，Agent通过查询程序图并提交带校验的patch进行编辑，而非修改文本行。每个patch包含图哈希和字段期望值，编译器在写入前会校验节点状态与类型，确保编辑具备语义锚点，避免了传统基于行号编辑的不可靠性。在Zero架构中，文本仅作为.0文件的投影存在，.graph文件才是真正的源码。目前Zero仍处于剧变期，仅发布13个release。尽管其旨在提升Agent编辑的准确性与可靠性，但社区对其必要性及相较于Python、TypeScript的量化优势仍存质疑，该项目目前更倾向于一种针对AI编程范式的思维实验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic披露未发布模型Model 2，性能表现略超Claude Mythos 5</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1f4fcddea8636a615b1eb55a41f7ac5a.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic在8月15日发布的《2026年8月风险报告》中披露了尚未正式发布的AI模型Model 2。根据报告中内部基准测试CoBench v2的对比结果，Model 2在多项任务上的性能表现优于当前公开的最强模型Claude Mythos 5。虽然性能提升幅度相对有限，但主要体现为AI综合能力的代际打磨。报告中同时提及了Model 1，外界推测Model 2可能是Model 1的后续版本，且两者均属于Claude Mythos Preview的进一步迭代。此次披露显示Anthropic正通过内部序号推进能力阶梯，其实际研发进度可能领先于公开命名。这一进展表明Anthropic在保持Claude Mythos系列领先优势的同时，正通过小步快跑的方式进行模型迭代，对行业而言，这意味着大模型在综合能力上的边际</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
